<title>USA: Rick's Cabaret says fund holds 6.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Rick's Cabaret says fund holds 6.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rick's Cabaret International Inc said on Friday The Rock Fund filed a 13-D with the Securities and Exchange Commission, indicating that the fund holds 6.5 percent of the company's stock.</p>
<p>The fund's intent is for investment purposes only, the chain of adult entertainment clubs said.</p>
